        description='Kind of code unit. databaseObject = SQL-defined object (table, view, procedure); script = single-file imperative code unit (BTEQ, FastLoad, SQL*Plus); etl = multi-artifact pipeline (SSIS, Informatica, DataStage); parameterizedReference = synthesized stub for a parameterized name reference, carrying ${NAME} / <% NAME %> tokens in source/target slots.',
